flowchart TD
    Start([User Interaction / Turn Submission]) --> ReceiveMsg[Receive Message & Initialize GameTurnManager]
    ReceiveMsg --> LoadContext[Load Session State, Avatar, Entities & Exits]
    LoadContext --> TickSystem[Advance In-Game Time & Apply Status Effects]
    
    TickSystem --> ModeCheck{Rule Enforcement Mode}
    
    subgraph Pass1 [Pass 1: Mechanics Check]
        direction TB
        SmallLLM[Small LLM: Evaluate Mechanics] --> ProposedEvent[Generate Proposed GameEvent JSON]
    end

    subgraph Pass15 [Pass 1.5: Validation & Reversion Gates]
        direction TB
        CheckExits{Exit Locks Valid?}
        CheckContainers{Container Unlocks Valid?}
        CheckSwitches{Switch Actions Valid?}
        CheckVisibility{Inspect/Search Targets Visible?}
        
        ProposedEvent --> CheckExits
        CheckExits -- Invalid --> RevertExit[Revert Exit State & Record Rule Violation]
        CheckExits -- Valid --> CheckContainers
        RevertExit --> CheckContainers
        
        CheckContainers -- Invalid --> RevertContainer[Revert Container State & Record Rule Violation]
        CheckContainers -- Valid --> CheckSwitches
        RevertContainer --> CheckSwitches
        
        CheckSwitches -- Invalid --> RevertSwitch[Revert Switch State & Record Rule Violation]
        CheckSwitches -- Valid --> CheckVisibility
        RevertSwitch --> CheckVisibility
        
        CheckVisibility -- Off-Scene Target --> BlockAction[Block Action & Record Rule Violation]
        CheckVisibility -- Accessible --> ValidatedEvent[Consolidate Validated GameEvent & Violations]
        BlockAction --> ValidatedEvent
    end

    subgraph Pass2 [Pass 2: Narration Generation]
        direction TB
        HasViolations{Has Rule Violations?}
        HasViolations -- Yes --> OverridePrompt[Override Narration Prompt with Failure Details]
        HasViolations -- No --> StandardPrompt[Standard Atmospheric Storytelling Prompt]
        OverridePrompt --> ComplexLLM[Complex LLM: Stream Narrative Prose]
        StandardPrompt --> ComplexLLM
    end

    ModeCheck -- RPG / Story Mode --> Pass1
    Pass1 --> Pass15
    Pass15 --> Pass2
    ModeCheck -- Chat Mode --> Pass2

    Pass2 --> ApplyState[Persist State to DB: Avatar Stats, Inventories, Scene Positions]
    ApplyState --> MapUpdate[MapEngine: Register Visited Scenes & Discovered Exits]
    MapUpdate --> QuestUpdate[Evaluate Quest Progression & Award Triggers]
    
    QuestUpdate --> VisualCheck{Auto-Visualize & Image Needed?}
    VisualCheck -- Yes --> GenImage[MediaEngine: Generate Scene/Entity Visual]
    GenImage --> SaveImage[Update Scene Image URL & Session State]
    VisualCheck -- No --> Finalize
    SaveImage --> Finalize
    
    Finalize[Emit SSE State & Final Event] --> TTSCheck{TTS Audio Enabled?}
    TTSCheck -- Yes --> GenAudio[TTSEngine: Strip Vocal Tags & Synthesize Audio]
    GenAudio --> End([End Turn & Play Audio in Client])
    TTSCheck -- No --> End

    style Pass1 fill:#e1f5fe,stroke:#01579b,stroke-width:1.5px
    style Pass15 fill:#fff3e0,stroke:#e65100,stroke-width:1.5px
    style Pass2 fill:#e8f5e9,stroke:#2e7d32,stroke-width:1.5px
